maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240307/842440921508352000954207.jpeg/RiWz3lKTiIpRvZsEwTEC5qIk_d-gmE3TcUmfoXFJn6E\"/><figcaption>前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240307/842440921520803840249561.jpeg/odKV5nRFq1sFFOAmS67i35kye7rtsVQGfBFprHwRaaw\"/><figcaption>前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240307/842440918362492928359784.jpeg/Sr2aHyykgU-t1Bv8TDCXp6IEUQSgOt4DkFB3xJBQd8Q\"/><figcaption>前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240307/842440920841326592307164.jpeg/Z7D-WTVSRAuKvBdgjH0xcA6Lmsnf74Y-QwXvTEMF70w\"/><figcaption>前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240307/842440921629855744185390.jpeg/ILmHmZ49xOhnWTUh0yVgKPZps4OkTnxb6VB6dOlQenQ\"/><figcaption>前田敦子（IG@atsuko_maeda_official）</figcaption></figure><p>開酸柳俊烈？韓韶禧驚天發言「想嫁帥哥」為孩子著想　公司聽完嚇壞了</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T07:39:02.991949+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1996,"images":43,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}